---- MY PROGRAMS ----
---------------------

-- The terminal, file manager and launcher commands now live in the keybind catalogue (keybinds.json).
-- Apps started from keybinds go through `uwsm app`: each gets its own systemd scope instead of living in the
-- compositor's cgroup. That keeps them out of the compositor's fate and lets systemd-oomd kill ONE app, not the session.


