---- AUTOSTART ----
-------------------

-- See https://wiki.hypr.land/Configuring/Basics/Autostart/

-- Autostart necessary processes (like notifications daemons, status bars, etc.)
-- Or execute your favorite apps at launch like this:
--
-- Lock at the start of every session: greetd logs in once at boot (scripts/install-autologin.sh) and hyprlock is the
-- login screen. bbkos-lock is flock-guarded, so it can never start twice. A login through tuigreet after a logout also
-- asks for the password once more; that is the price of a lock that cannot be skipped.
hl.on("hyprland.start", function () hl.exec_cmd("bbkos-lock") end)

